WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.319 --> 00:00:02.617
(comical music)
- Uh, yes, hello?

00:00:02.617 --> 00:00:06.774
Hi, um is this, IT?

00:00:06.774 --> 00:00:09.211
Hi IT, this is Elliott.

00:00:09.811 --> 00:00:13.327
Yeah, yeah I was just wondering,

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:18.314
who do I call to find out
how to work the phones?

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.285
Well, I don't know.

00:00:21.891 --> 00:00:24.268
No, no, I'm not crying.

00:00:26.294 --> 00:00:30.333
Yeah no, I know it's part
of my job to call clients.

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:32.039
Yeah, I know that I'm
on the phone right now.

00:00:32.039 --> 00:00:33.014
But when you're in an elevator

00:00:33.014 --> 00:00:34.617
do you know exactly how that works?

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:37.336
Hello? Hel, hello?

00:00:37.906 --> 00:00:39.364
Dammit.

00:00:39.645 --> 00:00:40.687
God.
- Do you honestly

00:00:40.687 --> 00:00:41.929
not know how the phones work?

00:00:41.929 --> 00:00:44.274
- What? Oh Shh ah Shh.

00:00:44.274 --> 00:00:45.471
- It's okay, don't worry.

00:00:45.471 --> 00:00:46.875
Don't cry or anything, I got it.

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:49.094
Here, here, I got it.

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:52.651
(chuckles) All better.

00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:54.717
- [Elliot] Thanks.
- No problem.

00:00:54.717 --> 00:00:56.626
Have a good one.

00:01:00.448 --> 00:01:04.053
- No problem, have a good one.

00:01:05.266 --> 00:01:06.600
(chuckles)

00:01:10.287 --> 00:01:14.194
I will Anna, I will have a good one.

00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:17.479
- Come on!

00:01:19.724 --> 00:01:22.303
- Hey there Harper,
you having some trouble

00:01:22.303 --> 00:01:24.044
with the old copy guy?

00:01:24.044 --> 00:01:27.202
- Yeah, it's not working, as always.

00:01:27.202 --> 00:01:29.302
- You wanna step aside
and let me give it a shot?

00:01:29.302 --> 00:01:30.580
- Yeah, go for it please.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.374
- All right.

00:01:32.983 --> 00:01:35.921
(tapping)

00:01:35.921 --> 00:01:37.906
- Oh!
- [Elliott] Boom!

00:01:37.906 --> 00:01:39.403
- Hmm.
- [Elliott] It's working.

00:01:39.403 --> 00:01:42.898
Did it, Elliott fixed the copier, guys.

00:01:42.898 --> 00:01:44.866
- Your fly.
- [Elliot] Thanks Harper,

00:01:44.866 --> 00:01:47.261
let's do one of these.

00:01:50.271 --> 00:01:51.483
All right.

00:01:51.483 --> 00:01:54.047
- We got a call from corporate
about yesterday's reports

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:57.624
because they found a
discrepancy inside the numbers.

00:01:57.624 --> 00:01:59.748
- Oh yeah, I straightened them out.

00:01:59.748 --> 00:02:00.717
- What?
- [Elliott] They were just

00:02:00.717 --> 00:02:04.154
using the wrong algorithm, so
the error was on their side.

00:02:04.154 --> 00:02:05.303
- You called corporate?

00:02:05.303 --> 00:02:07.695
- [Elliott] Yeah.
- And talked to a person?

00:02:07.695 --> 00:02:08.493
- [Elliott] Yep.

00:02:08.493 --> 00:02:09.667
- And you didn't cry?

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:11.465
- Nope, no tears.

00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:14.693
- You are feeling yourself, dude.

00:02:14.693 --> 00:02:15.888
- Wow.

00:02:18.508 --> 00:02:22.201
- (groans) No problem,

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:24.221
have a good one.

00:02:26.038 --> 00:02:28.924
- Uh, the meeting is not over.

00:02:30.728 --> 00:02:32.319
- Hey Elliott, hey.

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:33.885
- Hey Harper.

00:02:33.885 --> 00:02:35.464
- Um, your fly.

00:02:35.464 --> 00:02:37.484
- Ah no, you're fly.

00:02:37.484 --> 00:02:40.486
- No, your pants fly is open.

00:02:41.443 --> 00:02:42.802
- How long has it been?

00:02:42.802 --> 00:02:44.967
- I don't know, I tried
to tell you this morning.

00:02:46.437 --> 00:02:48.142
- Elliott fixed the copier, guys.

00:02:48.142 --> 00:02:49.547
- Your fly.

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:53.076
(chuckles)

00:02:53.076 --> 00:02:56.843
- (groans) No problem.

00:02:56.843 --> 00:03:01.045
Oh no, no, no, (sobs) oh no!

00:03:01.045 --> 00:03:02.799
Oh my god.

00:03:02.799 --> 00:03:04.563
Oh god.

00:03:04.563 --> 00:03:06.505
Okay.
(phone ringing)

00:03:06.505 --> 00:03:08.526
What, hello, what, what is it?

00:03:08.526 --> 00:03:11.079
I don't, yes, no this is Elliott.

00:03:11.079 --> 00:03:13.204
Oh yeah, that's, sorry.

00:03:13.204 --> 00:03:14.500
(laughing)

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.278
I'm sorry.

00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:17.612
- The discrepancy is coming
from inside the numbers!

00:03:17.612 --> 00:03:18.411
(laughing)

00:03:18.411 --> 00:03:19.289
- [Voiceover] All right, here we go.

00:03:19.289 --> 00:03:24.004
(vintage film reel sounds)

